a2f65ad03da9836db1408996bad4","event_uuid":"ef2eeb67-7f80-4ee2-b683-7933d4c51117","position":{"commit_sha":"01afdc5d3b98e06e92fa007a35f866ab1e688390","position":"1786137693866934001-ef2eeb67-7f80-4ee2-b683-7933d4c51117"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786047194710521001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"4852888d-6ed1-4ad0-b455-00af9a90327f","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"47e9-728e-ba93-485e"},{"link_uuid":"7c1fa84c-e950-4072-bc13-f66830c637f5","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"3591-689c-a353-4f5a"}],"description":"Surfaced by the comment triage, and it is a live contract defect rather than a comment problem.\n\n`_mcp_models.py` hand-mirrors five committed JSON schemas as pydantic models, each with an explicit\n\"Mirrors src/rebar/schemas/<name>.schema.json\" comment and no generator or drift gate.\n\n**The drift is real and shipped.** `BridgeFsckOut` (`_mcp_models.py:185`) declares three properties;\n`bridge_fsck.schema.json` has four — `binding_drift` is missing. `_engine_support/bridge_fsck.py:217`\nemits it unconditionally, and the generated `types.py:311` has it. So the MCP `outputSchema`\nadvertised to clients under-declares a field the tool always returns.\n\n**And the comment that should have caught it asserts an enforcement that does not exist.**\n`_mcp_models.py:31-34` claims \"the cross-interface schema tests pin both to the canonical schema\" —\nbut `rg BridgeFsckOut|GroundingInfoOut|WorkflowRunOut tests/` returns ZERO hits. No test pins these\nthree. That false assurance is precisely why the drift went unnoticed.\n\nA second drift found in the same sweep: `VerifySignatureResultOut` (`:210`) makes `algorithm`,\n`head_sha` and `key_id` optional while the schema requires all three.\n\nThe sibling TypedDict layer already has the fix pattern: `schemas/gen_types.py` generates it and CI\nenforces currency via `python -m rebar.schemas.gen_types --check`\n(`.github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml:545`). The MCP model layer — the other consumer of the same\nschemas — has no equivalent.\n\nExtending the generator to cover `_mcp_models.py` closes the drift class permanently and deletes\nthe five \"Mirrors ...\" comments as a side effect.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `BridgeFsckOut` declares `binding_drift`\n- [ ] `VerifySignatureResultOut`'s required set matches its schema\n- [ ] The MCP model layer is generated from the schemas, or covered by an equivalent `--check` drift gate\n- [ ] The false \"cross-interface schema tests pin both\" comment is removed or made true\n- [ ] The five hand-sync \"Mirrors ...\" comments are gone","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["depends_on","47e9-728e-ba93-485e"],["parent","b5bc-f4f7-3433-4181"],["relates_to","3591-689c-a353-4f5a"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"b5bc-f4f7-3433-4181","parent_status_uuid":"666569e5-b6d9-4e5b-9520-da0e23a9eb32","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["janitor"],"ticket_id":"8efe-9ceb-7d89-4a33","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Close the MCP model schema drift and gate it","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["dec1aa9d-3dbe-4dce-bda5-1419228525ee","4852888d-6ed1-4ad0-b455-00af9a90327f","b8161843-52aa-45dd-a263-406cc197cc59","666569e5-b6d9-4e5b-9520-da0e23a9eb32","ef2eeb67-7f80-4ee2-b683-7933d4c51117","7c1fa84c-e950-4072-bc13-f66830c637f5"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786139059592450048,"uuid":"111ca3db-74ec-4c9c-b019-9106083d44a2"}